  "_notes": {
    "gray": "One neutral scale built on the 2026 brand grays. gray100 (#f4f4f4) and gray600 (#55585a) are brand values. gray300 (#c4c4c4, brand gray #2) is decorative only: 1.74:1 on white. gray400 is the lightest gray allowed for icons and input borders (3.25:1). gray500 is the lightest gray allowed for text (5.13:1 on white, 4.79:1 on surface.page). The brand text gray #75787b is not used for text because it fails 4.5:1.",
